# Exceptions to tools/check-no-hosts.sh, one per line: `<glob><TAB><regex>`. The glob matches
# `<tree>/<path>` (tree: app, lepic, lepic-flutter); text the regex matches on a line of such a
# file is ignored. Every exception has a comment above it saying why. There are none: every
# address lives in a settings file (docs/settings-file.md).
